; Hand-written odoc pages. hegel_jane_concurrent.mld documents the OxCaml-only
; hegel.jane.concurrent sublibrary: it cannot compile where the docs are built
; (upstream OCaml, no Jane Street `concurrent`), so odoc never sees its
; interface and the page carries the signature by hand. Keep it in sync with
; lib/jane/concurrent/hegel_jane_concurrent.mli. oxcaml_api.mld lists every
; public signature that carries a mode annotation on OxCaml; keep it in sync
; with the .mli.in files.

(documentation
 (package hegel)
 (mld_files hegel_jane_concurrent oxcaml_api))
